        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The parties agree that should a Steward be required to leave the job as a result of duties required under Section D.3.a.c. of Article XXIII and their Supervisor is not available, they will be allowed to proceed after leaving their supervisor a voice mail message, or if voice mail is not available, a written note. This message should inform the Supervisor of the approximate time departed, destination and a general statement of the reason for their required absence.",
